ing primary care at one office, one changed to a specialty, one left the practice, and stopped practicing medicine  altogether? all because of COVID. And now I?m in a nursing home at 42 years of age. Even with regular contact with a care manager set up by insurance company who calls me regularly it was still very hard to get adequate healthcare services on a consistent basis. Something needs to be done locally but I don?t have all the answers, unfortunately.','Don\'t Know','4','Don\'t Know','3','Don\'t Know','Don\'t Know','2','Don\'t Know','Don\'t Know','Don\'t Know','Hard to obtain1','2','3','2','Don\'t Know','Don\'t Know','Don\'t Know','3','3','Yes','\"No\"','\"Yes\"','\"Yes\"','\"No\"','I am sometimes able to access healthcare services when needed.','\"Too much time to wait before an appointment \",\"Provider does not accept my insurance\",\"Doctor not accepting new patients\",\"Other\"','Because of having to keep switching PCPs it became difficult to get any kind of continuity of care.','Yes','Yes','No','No','Not sure','No','Yes','Yes','Yes','Yes','Yes','Yes','','No','Prefer not to answer','Not sure','Yes','Specialists','It?s common to travel to Herkimer County or Bassett in Cooperstown for specialists, let alone more advanced testing and diagnostics. In the nursing home there are residents who have to travel to Syracuse, Albany, etc.','I personally have had to go to Cooperstown and Herkimer County before.','\"Adult substance use (alcohol or legal medications)\",\"Depression/Anxiety\",\"Bullying\",\"Not having enough money for food\",\"Not having enough money for healthy food\",\"Not having enough money for transportation\",\"Not having enough money for housing\",\"Use of tobacco products/vaping products\"','\"Access to healthy and affordable foods   \",\"Increasing preventive care (i.e., wellness visits, annual physicals)   \",\"Improving children and teens physical, social, and emotional health   \",\"Promoting well-being and resilience    \",\"Improve mental 